meta {
  name: Master App Settings
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/master/settings
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  X-Locale: {{locale}}
}

docs {
  # Master App Settings

  Public endpoint. Returns the master-side rules/terms of use configured in the
  admin panel. Show this on the "become a master" screen, before the
  application form — no auth required.

  **Response 200:**
  ```json
  {
    "data": { "content": "<h1>Правила</h1><p>Текст правил пользования...</p>" }
  }
  ```

  `content` is raw HTML — render it in a WebView or parse it. Returns an empty
  string `""` when no rules have been configured yet.
}
